---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Dr. Richard J Gill — Fallbrook's Trusted General Dentist"
  description="Dr. Richard J Gill leads Downtown Dental Studio in Fallbrook, CA. Learn about his experience, philosophy, and the team behind your smile."
  pageType="business"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="container-max section">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-dental-900 mb-4">Meet Dr. Richard J Gill</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-500">Dedicated to providing exceptional dental care to the Fallbrook community for over 20 years.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bio -->
  <section class="container-max section-padding">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-1">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/images/dr-gill-headshot.webp" type="image/webp">
          <img
            src="/images/dr-gill-headshot.jpg"
            alt="Dr. Richard J Gill, DDS — Downtown Dental Studio, Fallbrook CA"
            class="rounded-3xl shadow-lg w-full"
            width="600"
            height="900"
            loading="eager"
          >
        </picture>
        <div class="mt-6 bg-avocado-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-avocado-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-avocado-800 font-[family:var(--font-heading)]">Dr. Richard J Gill, DDS</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Owner & Lead Dentist</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Richard J Gill DDS & Associates, APC</p>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
            <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-700">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-leaf-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1 1 15 0Z"/></svg>
              Fallbrook, CA
            </p>
            <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-700">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-leaf-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.26 10.147a60.438 60.438 0 0 0-.491 6.347A48.62 48.62 0 0 1 12 20.904a48.62 48.62 0 0 1 8.232-4.41 60.46 60.46 0 0 0-.491-6.347m-15.482 0a50.636 50.636 0 0 0-2.658-.813A59.906 59.906 0 0 1 12 3.493a59.903 59.903 0 0 1 10.399 5.84c-.896.248-1.783.52-2.658.814m-15.482 0A50.717 50.717 0 0 1 12 13.489a50.702 50.702 0 0 1 7.74-3.342M6.75 15a.75.75 0 1 0 0-1.5.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.5Zm0 0v-3.675A55.378 55.378 0 0 1 12 8.443m-7.007 11.55A5.981 5.981 0 0 0 6.75 15.75v-1.5"/></svg>
              Doctor of Dental Surgery
            </p>
            <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-700">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-leaf-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z"/></svg>
              20+ Years Experience
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-avocado-800 mb-4 font-[family:var(--font-heading)]">A Passion for Smiles</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Dr. Richard J Gill has been transforming smiles and building lasting relationships 
            with patients in the Fallbrook community for over two decades. His philosophy is simple: 
            treat every patient like family, and deliver care that's as gentle as it is effective.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-4">
            At Downtown Dental Studio, Dr. Gill leads a team dedicated to making dental visits 
            something patients actually look forward to. From the warm greeting at the front desk 
            to the comfortable treatment rooms, every detail is designed with your comfort in mind.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-avocado-800 mb-4 font-[family:var(--font-heading)]">Our Approach</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="card">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Patient-First Philosophy</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">We listen. Every treatment starts with understanding your goals, concerns, and budget.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Advanced Technology</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Modern diagnostic and treatment tools for precise, comfortable, and efficient care.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Transparent Pricing</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">No surprises. We discuss costs upfront and offer flexible payment options.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Continuing Education</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Dr. Gill stays current with the latest techniques through ongoing professional development.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-avocado-800 mb-4 font-[family:var(--font-heading)]">Serving Fallbrook & Beyond</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Our practice proudly serves patients from Fallbrook, Bonsall, Rainbow, Temecula, 
            and throughout North San Diego County. We're conveniently located at 1180 S Main Ave 
            — easy to find with plenty of parking.
          </p>
          <picture class="mt-6 block">
            <source srcset="/images/treatment-room.webp" type="image/webp">
            <img
              src="/images/treatment-room.jpg"
              alt="Treatment room at Downtown Dental Studio — Fallbrook, CA"
              class="rounded-2xl shadow-md w-full"
              width="1200"
              height="800"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          </picture>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-avocado-50">
    <div class="container-max px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-avocado-800 mb-4 font-[family:var(--font-heading)]">Schedule Your Visit</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">Experience the Downtown Dental Studio difference. New patients are always welcome.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="tel:4423177000" class="btn-primary">📞 (442) 317-7000</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-secondary">Request Appointment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
